### =====================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION - REGISTRATION
### =====================================================

### Register Employee
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Employee",
  "email": "testemployee@gmail.com",
  "password": "Employee@123",
  "role": "MANAGER"
}


### Register Another Employee
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul",
  "email": "rahul2@gmail.com",
  "password": "Rahul@123",
  "role": "EMPLOYEE"
}


### Register Manager
### NOTE: Public registration now assigns EMPLOYEE role.
### Use your existing manager account for manager testing.


### =====================================================
### 2. LOGIN - GET JWT TOKENS
### =====================================================

### Employee Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sneha@example.com",
  "password": "Sneha@123"
}


### Manager Login
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@example.com",
  "password": "Manager@123"
}


### =====================================================
### 3. EMPLOYEE CRUD
### =====================================================

### Add Employee
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Amit",
  "email": "amit@gmail.com",
  "department": "IT",
  "salary": 55000
}


### Get All Employees
GET http://localhost:8080/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### Get Employee By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/3
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### Update Employee
PUT http://localhost:8080/employees/3
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sneha Kaushik",
  "email": "sneha@gmail.com",
  "department": "Java Development",
  "salary": 75000
}


### Delete Employee
DELETE http://localhost:8080/employees/3
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### Search Employee By Email
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/email/sneha@gmail.com
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### Search Employee By Department
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/department/IT
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### =====================================================
### 4. EMPLOYEE DTO APIs
### =====================================================

### Create Employee Using DTO
POST http://localhost:8080/employees/dto
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Priya",
  "email": "priya@gmail.com",
  "department": "HR",
  "salary": 60000
}


### Get Employee DTO
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/3/dto
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### =====================================================
### 5. VALIDATION TESTING
### =====================================================

### Invalid Employee - Empty Name, Invalid Email, Negative Salary
POST http://localhost:8080/employees/dto
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "wrongemail",
  "department": "",
  "salary": -5000
}


### =====================================================
### 6. PAGINATION
### =====================================================

### First Page
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/pagination?page=0&size=2
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### Second Page
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/pagination?page=1&size=2
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### =====================================================
### 7. SORTING
### =====================================================

### Sort By Name
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/sort?field=name
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### Sort By Salary
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/sort?field=salary
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### =====================================================
### 8. PAGINATION + SORTING
### =====================================================

### First Page Sorted By Name
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/pagination-sort?page=0&size=2&field=name
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### =====================================================
### 9. LEAVE MANAGEMENT
### =====================================================

### Apply Leave
POST http://localhost:8080/leaves/apply/2
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-11-20",
  "endDate": "2026-11-22",
  "reason": "Medical Leave"
}


### Get All Leaves - Manager
GET http://localhost:8080/leaves
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### Get Leaves By Employee ID
GET http://localhost:8080/leaves/employee/2
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### Get Pending Leaves
GET http://localhost:8080/leaves/status/PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### Get Approved Leaves
GET http://localhost:8080/leaves/status/APPROVED
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### Get Rejected Leaves
GET http://localhost:8080/leaves/status/REJECTED
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### =====================================================
### 10. MANAGER APPROVAL APIs
### =====================================================

### Approve Leave - MANAGER ONLY
PUT http://localhost:8080/leaves/approve/2
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### Reject Leave - MANAGER ONLY
PUT http://localhost:8080/leaves/reject/2
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### =====================================================
### 11. AUTHORIZATION TESTING
### =====================================================

### Employee Trying to Approve Leave
### Expected: 403 Forbidden
PUT http://localhost:8080/leaves/approve/2
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### Employee Trying to Reject Leave
### Expected: 403 Forbidden
PUT http://localhost:8080/leaves/reject/2
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### Access Employees Without Token
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/employees


### Access Employees With Invalid Token
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/employees
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token


### =====================================================
### 12. EXCEPTION HANDLING
### =====================================================

### Employee Not Found
### Expected: 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/999
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### Apply Leave With Invalid Employee
### Expected: 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/leaves/apply/999
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-11-20",
  "endDate": "2026-11-22",
  "reason": "Medical Leave"
}


### Approve Invalid Leave
### Expected: 404 Not Found
PUT http://localhost:8080/leaves/approve/999
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}


### =====================================================
### 13. DUPLICATE REGISTRATION
### =====================================================

### Register Existing Email
### Expected: Registration failure
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sneha",
  "email": "sneha@example.com",
  "password": "Sneha@123"
}